{
  "_doc": "THE SHARED TASK MAPPING (libs:ai): a task is a job (translate, summarize, ...) with the agent and the model that run it. Cloud Tools Small LLMs' build.json::tools.tasks is where the jobs and their worker models are declared; this file carries each one's id, label, icon and worker so every chat can offer the Task control (the composer greys Agent and Model and sets them from here). test-tools-app.sh holds the two in step in both directions (same ids, same worker). `agent` is a gateway mode: `openrouter` runs the named OpenRouter model (the model id is the worker, priced by libs:model-catalogue). Cloud Code reads this file through tools/resolve-targets.py (targets.gen.json chat.tasks).",
